  "job_B21.3_20251003_114553": {
    "chunk_text": "an cytele & wyll o\u00f0\u00f0\u00e6t heo sy swi\u00fee Wi\u00f0 hwostan eft, genim hunan, seo\u00f0 on w\u00e6tere, syle swa wearme drincan. Eft, genim clifwyrt, sume men hata\u00f0 foxesclife, sume eawyrt, & heo sy geworht ofer midne sumor, Ge\u00feicge. Gif w\u00e6nnas eglian m\u00e6n \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6re heortan, gange m\u00e6den man to wylle \u00fee rihte east yrne & gehlade Wi\u00f0 heortw\u00e6rce, rudan gelm, seo\u00f0 on ele & do alwan ane ynsan to smyre mid \u00fey, \u00fe\u00e6t stil\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m Wi\u00f0 heortece, gif him on innan heard heortw\u00e6rc sy, \u00feonne him wyxst wind on \u00fe\u00e6re heortan & hine Wyrc him \u00feonne stanb\u00e6\u00f0, & on \u00fe\u00e6m ete su\u00feerne r\u00e6dic mid sealte, mid \u00fey m\u00e6g seo wund wesan Wi\u00f0 heortece eft, genim gi\u00f0rifan, seo\u00f0 on meolce, syle drincan syx dagas. Eft, neo\u00feeweard eoforfarn, gi\u00f0rifan, wegbr\u00e6dan, wyl tosomne, syle drincan. Wi\u00f0 breostnyrwette, \u00feus sceal beon se l\u00e6cecr\u00e6ft geworht, \u00fe\u00e6t man nime ane cuppan gemeredes \u00dery dagas syndon on geare \u00fee we egiptiaci hata\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t is on ure ge\u00feeode plihtlice dagas, on \u00feam Se \u00fee on \u00feysum \u00ferim dagum his blod gewanige, sy hit man, sy hit nyten, \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee we secgan Sancte rehhoc & sancte rehwalde & sancte cassiane & sancte germane & sancte sigismunde rex,.",
